\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {4}{\ignorespaces Performance comparison of traditional PSO variants and APEXPSO across three scenarios. Nine algorithms are evaluated: APEXPSO (RL-based SAC with global parameter control), traditional PSO variants with fixed/time-varying parameters, fully informed PSO, comprehensive learning PSO, adaptive coefficients, and self-adaptive strategies (SAEPSO, UAPSO). Results show mean, standard deviation, minimum, and maximum global best fitness over 30 independent runs per scenario. Lower fitness values indicate better path quality. Bold values indicate best performance in each column.}}{15}{table.caption.9}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:others_comparison}{{4}{15}{Performance comparison of traditional PSO variants and APEXPSO across three scenarios. Nine algorithms are evaluated: APEXPSO (RL-based SAC with global parameter control), traditional PSO variants with fixed/time-varying parameters, fully informed PSO, comprehensive learning PSO, adaptive coefficients, and self-adaptive strategies (SAEPSO, UAPSO). Results show mean, standard deviation, minimum, and maximum global best fitness over 30 independent runs per scenario. Lower fitness values indicate better path quality. Bold values indicate best performance in each column}{table.caption.9}{}}
